    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2777\"><em data-start=\"2763\" data-end=\"2777\">(10th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> +1</p><p data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2842\">When a creature violates a binding contract or major precedent:</p><ul data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2928\"><li data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2890\"><p data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2890\">Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on its next roll,<strong data-start=\"2884\" data-end=\"2890\">or</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2928\"><p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2928\">Suppress one ability for the round.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2930\" data-end=\"3095\">If the creature is <strong data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2970\">Out of Compliance</strong>, you may spend 1 Civic Charge to escalate the suppression to a full round of denial for a specific feature (GM adjudicated).</p><p data-start=\"3097\" data-end=\"3156\">You are not retaliating.<br data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3124\" />You are documenting consequence.</p>",
